{"message":"I reviewed your 17 completed transactions and found one apparent cash-back error:

- Chipotle — 11/07/2025 — $369.55 on your Business Bronze Rewards Card: credited 184 points ($1.84), but the 1% rate should produce 369 points ($3.69) after rounding down. This is a shortfall of 185 points, or $1.85.

The other transactions appear consistent with the applicable rules. In particular, WeWork correctly received 0 points because coworking-space merchants are excluded, and EcoCard purchases at Amazon and ThredUp correctly received the standard 1-point-per-dollar rate. EcoCard green purchases also received the expected 5-point-per-dollar rate. I have not changed the transaction or rewards balance."}
